{"parse": {"title": "Silver Star", "pageid": 2859, "revid": 28725, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Silver Star</b>, added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 12</a>, was a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (6th Season).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"As Everything happens for a reason, our destiny slowly takes form\"</i></span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raylay\" title=\"Raylay\"><img alt=\"Raylay\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Raylay.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20250317215638\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"59\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Raylay.png\" data-image-key=\"Raylay.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Raylay</div></dd>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261019215929\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.121 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1974/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 363/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.070/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 5999105/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  109.018      1 Template:Container_Characterbox\n100.00%  109.018      1 -total\n 97.86%  106.680      1 Template:Characterbox\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:2859-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261019215929 and revision id 28725. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["Raylay.png"], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Information", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Silver_Star", "byteoffset": 145, "anchor": "Information", "linkAnchor": "Information"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Rewards", "number": "2", "index": "2", "fromtitle": "Silver_Star", "byteoffset": 551, "anchor": "Rewards", "linkAnchor": "Rewards"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Silver Star</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=28725&prop=text%7Cimages%7Csections%7Cdisplaytitle&format=json&formatversion=2&disableeditsection=1", "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T13:51:19.366082+00:00", "sha256": "f7f95e8d1fb10ca42c2c8327